*************************VQAL**************************














RECODE SHS4 (1=7) (2=6) (3=5) (4=4) (5=3) (6=2) (7=1) INTO SHS4_REC.
VARIABLE LABELS  SHS4_REC 'SHS4_REC'.
EXECUTE.
RECODE RSLEQ21 (1=5) (2=4) (3=3) (4=2) (5=1) INTO RSLEQ21_REC.
VARIABLE LABELS  RSLEQ21_REC 'RSLEQ21_REC'.
EXECUTE.
RECODE RSLEQ3 (1=5) (2=4) (3=3) (4=2) (5=1) INTO RSLEQ3_REC.
VARIABLE LABELS  RSLEQ3_REC 'RSLEQ3_REC'.
EXECUTE.
RECODE RSLEQ18 (1=5) (2=4) (3=3) (4=2) (5=1) INTO RSLEQ18_REC.
VARIABLE LABELS  RSLEQ18_REC 'RSLEQ18_REC'.
EXECUTE.
RECODE RSLEQ9 (1=5) (2=4) (3=3) (4=2) (5=1) INTO RSLEQ9_REC.
VARIABLE LABELS  RSLEQ9_REC 'RSLEQ9_REC'.
EXECUTE.
RECODE RSLEQ14 (1=5) (2=4) (3=3) (4=2) (5=1) INTO RSLEQ14_REC.
VARIABLE LABELS  RSLEQ14_REC 'RSLEQ14_REC'.
EXECUTE.
RECODE RSLEQ10 (1=5) (2=4) (3=3) (4=2) (5=1) INTO RSLEQ10_REC.
VARIABLE LABELS  RSLEQ10_REC 'RSLEQ10_REC'.
EXECUTE.
RECODE RSLEQ16 (1=5) (2=4) (3=3) (4=2) (5=1) INTO RSLEQ16_REC.
VARIABLE LABELS  RSLEQ16_REC 'RSLEQ16_REC'.
EXECUTE.
RECODE RSLEQ20 (1=5) (2=4) (3=3) (4=2) (5=1) INTO RSLEQ20_REC.
VARIABLE LABELS  RSLEQ20_REC 'RSLEQ20_REC'.
EXECUTE.
RECODE Arido (1=5) (2=4) (3=3) (4=2) (5=1) INTO RSLEQ20_REC.
VARIABLE LABELS  RSLEQ20_REC 'RSLEQ20_REC'.
EXECUTE.






DATASET ACTIVATE Dataset1.
CORRELATIONS
  /VARIABLES=SWLS IHS SHS NFR DASSdep DASSanx DASSstress with PRSfascina PRSb.away PRScohe PRSscope 
    VQALarido VQALvivace VQALcalmo RSLEQcollabo RSLEQstud.relations RSLEQsch.ressources 
    RSLEQdeci.making RSLEQinstru.innovations
  /PRINT=TWOTAIL NOSIG
  /MISSING=PAIRWISE.

